WEBVTT

1
00:00:03,150 --> 00:00:05,950
Just throw the other things here first.

2
00:00:05,950 --> 00:00:07,870
Maybe it can save other people's lives too

3
00:00:07,870 --> 00:00:09,550
Anyway, I don’t need to take it away.

4
00:00:09,550 --> 00:00:11,310
Return to Yuelu Community from here

5
00:00:11,310 --> 00:00:12,990
It will take almost an hour

6
00:00:12,990 --> 00:00:15,590
Anyway, if there are other urgent matters in the future, I will come out again.

7
00:00:15,590 --> 00:00:17,500
And no one can compete with me

8
00:00:17,500 --> 00:00:20,900
I’ll save the other places for later and explore them slowly.

9
00:00:20,900 --> 00:00:42,990
There is also this kind of thing

10
00:00:42,990 --> 00:00:45,300
You can also run in the snow

11
00:00:45,300 --> 00:00:47,210
Such a good thing

12
00:00:47,210 --> 00:00:49,210
If we could use it

13
00:00:49,210 --> 00:00:51,530
You can go out to find something to eat from now on.

14
00:00:51,530 --> 00:00:53,970
There is no need to eat those sour meats
